    <bpmn:process id="W_W2844" name="W2844. MSME Point-of-Sale / Inventory App Provisioning &amp; Support" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: MSME opts into BuildRight-provided digital tools
Frequency: Event-driven + ongoing support
Volume: ~5,000–10,000 MSMEs at maturity
Owner: IT Product Manager
Participants: IT, MSME Sales, Customer Service
Source: workflow W2844 — MSME Point-of-Sale / Inventory App Provisioning &amp; Support</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2844_LaneSet3">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2844_Lane1" name="IT">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2844_Task5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2844_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2844_Start4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W2844_Lane2" name="Customer Service">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2844_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2844_End8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2844_Start4" name="MSME opts into BuildRight-provided digital tools">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2844_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2844_Task5" name="IT provisions MSME with BuildRight-provided POS/inventory app (or integration…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: IT provisions MSME with BuildRight-provided POS/inventory app (or integration with sari-sari POS); configures reorder templates and supplier linkage
Responsible (R): IT
Accountable (A): IT Product Manager
Duration: Per account</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2844_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2844_Flow11</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2844_Task6" name="Customer Service trains MSME on app usage; provides hotline/chat support…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Customer Service trains MSME on app usage; provides hotline/chat support; monitors adoption and issues
Responsible (R): Customer Service
Accountable (A): MSME Sales Manager
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2844_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2844_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2844_Task7" name="IT maintains app, security patches, and integration with BuildRight…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: IT maintains app, security patches, and integration with BuildRight catalog/order system; manages data privacy and consent
Responsible (R): IT
